# Copy to .env.local for local overrides. Next.js inlines NEXT_PUBLIC_* values at build time.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL  base URL of the FastAPI backend that the browser calls for GET /health,
#                           POST /api/simulate, POST /api/explain and GET /api/history.
#                           Blank means http://127.0.0.1:8000.
#                           The backend must allow this site's origin (CORS), or the browser blocks
#                           every call and the page reports the live engine as not reachable.
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=
